{"unit":{"id":"l3-u66","level":3,"order":171,"title":"Unit 66","wordIds":["w:服务员","w:电台","w:金牌","w:工程师","w:优点","w:完善","w:旅馆","w:志愿者","w:发达","w:人工","w:普遍","w:爱心"],"grammarIds":["g:pubian-widely"],"sentenceIds":["s:l3:264","s:l3:265","s:l3:266"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:pubian-widely","title":"Commonly, widely with 普遍","pattern":"普遍 + 动词/形容词","explanation":"普遍 (pǔbiàn) means \"widely, commonly, universally\" — describing something true for most people or cases, not just a few. It goes right before the verb or adjective.","level":3,"sentenceIds":["s:l3:264","s:l3:265","s:l3:266"],"unitId":"l3-u66"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l3:264","zh":"这个问题普遍存在。","pinyin":"Zhège wèntí pǔbiàn cúnzài.","en":"This problem widely exists.","wordIds":["w:这","w:个","w:问题","w:普遍","w:存在"],"unitId":"l3-u66"},{"id":"s:l3:265","zh":"现在大家普遍使用手机。","pinyin":"Xiànzài dàjiā pǔbiàn shǐyòng shǒujī.","en":"Nowadays everyone commonly uses phones.","wordIds":["w:现在","w:大家","w:普遍","w:使用","w:手机"],"unitId":"l3-u66"},{"id":"s:l3:266","zh":"这种想法很普遍。","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎngfǎ hěn pǔbiàn.","en":"This kind of thinking is very common.","wordIds":["w:这","w:种","w:想法","w:很","w:普遍"],"unitId":"l3-u66"}]}
